{"id":"5ddfe8b261dc66b6","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-topo10-gdelta-set-code.md","title":"ZFC Topo10 Gdelta Set Code","display":"df-zfc-topo10-gdelta-set-code — ZFC Topo10 Gdelta Set Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo10-gdelta-set-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo10-gdelta-set-code"],"display":"df-zfc-topo10-gdelta-set-code — ZFC Topo10 Gdelta Set Code","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence]]","[[58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo10-gdelta-set-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo10-gdelta-set-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo10-gdelta-set-code — ZFC Topo10 Gdelta Set Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d490b03448142d4c\" href=\"?note=d490b03448142d4c\" title=\"58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence\">58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9cf21178fae2ba8e\" href=\"?note=9cf21178fae2ba8e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection\">58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,X,\\tau,G\\in V\">\\(A,X,\\tau,G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\\)</span> (omega-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d490b03448142d4c\" href=\"?note=d490b03448142d4c\" title=\"58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence\">58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10GdeltaSetCode}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10GdeltaSetCode}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}gdelta\\text{-}set\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10GdeltaSetCode}_S(A,X,\\tau,G)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(G,\\tau)\\land A=\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}G(n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}gdelta\\text{-}set\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10GdeltaSetCode}_S(A,X,\\tau,G)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(G,\\tau)\\land A=\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}G(n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> is a typed omega-sequence of open sets, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is exactly their intersection; hence it codes a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\delta\">\\(G_\\delta\\)</span> subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"d490b03448142d4c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection","status":"resolved","id":"9cf21178fae2ba8e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set-indexed-intersection]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"d490b03448142d4c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S$ (omega-sequence predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"A,X,\\tau,G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10GdeltaSetCode}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}gdelta\\text{-}set\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10GdeltaSetCode}_S(A,X,\\tau,G)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(G,\\tau)\\land A=\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}G(n)","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"G_\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1223,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3659","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo10-gdelta-set-code.md|58-df-zfc-topo10-gdelta-set-code]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","74086485fba8d86f","d490b03448142d4c","9cf21178fae2ba8e"]}